just bury Area 51 with an earthquake?<br /> <br /> As for why the new Gods don't like the old Gods: same reason anyone new in power doesn't like the established power. The established power is keeping the new power from getting more powerful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T20:55:10-08:00","id":40327,"title":"","content":"As far as the spear goes, there are several tales of mythic spears and the Spear of Longinus could just be the latest incarnation or perhaps the ideal version of all of these powerful spears.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T22:15:00-08:00","id":40353,"title":"","content":"What I know of the Spear of Longinus (or Lance) was that it was the Spear a Roman Soldier pierced Jesus with to make sure he was really dead. And Adolf Hitler had it because of his interest in the Occult.<br /> <br /> <br /> As for a Fiasco? Have you ever heard of something called the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tunguska_event\" target=\"_blank\">Tunguska Event?</a> Seems like the perfect thing to make the Gods straight up not wanna fuss with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T23:30:55-08:00","id":40376,"title":"","content":"Yes, but what does that mean in terms of Scion, where there is no Abrahamic God?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T00:35:02-08:00","id":40398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/40218-looking-for-help-to-writte-my-campaing?p=40376#post40376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, but what does that mean in terms of Scion, where there is no Abrahamic God?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I explained that in my first post. Just because there is no canon Abrahamic God, then there is no reason why the spear that is claiming to be the Spear of Longinus does not mean that it is powerful due to piercing the side of Christ. Not to mention, there might not be a canon Abrahamic God but there is no reason that he cannot, in his game, say there is one. There is enough fan material enough for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T18:09:35-08:00","id":40854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/40218-looking-for-help-to-writte-my-campaing?p=40376#post40376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, but what does that mean in terms of Scion, where there is no Abrahamic God?</div> </div> </div> </div>Just make it Areadbhar and you sidestep the problem.<br /> <br /> Just to add, Areadbhar is a bastardization of Gaelic that originally meant &quot;The Fate of the Children of Tuirean,&quot; e.g. the spear of destiny. So...not actually a huge stretch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":889,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/889-dayen","user":"Dayen","date":". 01-01-2014, 09:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/889-dayen","name":"Dayen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}